        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Gatekeeper Aura"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(abjuration, aura, occult)\n\n60 feet. A creature that uses a teleportation ability within the aura's emanation or enters it via a teleportation ability must succeed a 38 Will save or become sickened 1 and have its destination changed to a point of the radiant warden's choosing within the emanation. On a successful save, the creature arrives as intended but is still sickened 1."
            },
